            </h2>

            <p class="sub-heading" id="subheading-large">
                We have numerous properties available for sale and receive a 
                significant number of new listings daily.
                Make sure you don't miss out on the latest additions.
            </p>

            <div class="create">
                <a href="https://app.immobiliermatrixfrance.fr/register" class="btn-large latest-btn">
                    Begin your search today
                </a>
    
               <div class="registered" id="registered">
                    <p>Already registered?</p>
                    <a href="https://app.immobiliermatrixfrance.fr/login">Log in now</a>
               </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
